eal-world environment for effective and engaging meetings without them leaving their desks, let alone their cities.\n\nFeatures of the app include sharing presentations and video, creating bespoke surveys with real time results and more, all the while interacting with each other in person even if spread across the world.\n\nUp to 8 people can focus and communicate with each-other in any environment you choose - from the Agority lobby to Piccadilly Circus or a tropical rainforest.", "short_description": "Spinview\u2019s Agority platform helps you immerse your team, your clients and stakeholders in a real-world environment for effective and engaging meetings without them leaving their desks, let alone their cities.\n\nFeatures of the app include sharing presentations and video, creating bespoke surveys with real time results and more, all the while interacting with each other in person even if spread across the world."}]}, "developer_name": "Spinview", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://spinview.io/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://app.spinviewglobal.com/", "publisher_name": "Spinview Global Limited", "support_website_url": "https://app.spinviewglobal.com/", "website_url": "https://app.spinviewglobal.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "354062412981040"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5